Landscape update
----------------

The background agent landscape keeps growing. Since launch we have added 15=
 tools across security, sandboxes, orchestration, review, and agents. Notab=
le additions: Cursor Cloud, Vercel Agent, Warp, Northflank, Namespace, nono=
, and Agent Auth Protocol. If we missed your tool or miscategorized it, let=
 us know.

Explore the landscape =E2=86=92 ( https://background-agents.com/landscape?u=
tm_campaign=3Ddomino-ramp-stripe&utm_source=3Dcustomerio&utm_medium=3Demail=
 )

--------------------------------------------
Background Agents Virtual Summit (Early May)
--------------------------------------------

Last week we mentioned we were working on a virtual summit. It is taking sh=
ape. Three tracks: scaling agent infrastructure, security and governance, a=
nd how engineering orgs actually change when agents produce a significant s=
hare of code. Every session is grounded in real architecture and real outco=
mes from industry leaders.

We'd love to have you join. If you are running background agents or activel=
y building toward it and want to share what you have learned, please reach =
out with a simple reply.

